<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Water the Roses</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">FLAVOR FOLEY</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">CARDIAC CONTREPOINT</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5mOkAoUjyCFHjlpsBe30e1</ttm:item><itunes:duration>04:27.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.350" end="00:03.140">I guess can’t be hoped</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.140" end="00:05.000">It’s just a matter of when</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.000" end="00:06.780">Do you think she’d notice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.780" end="00:08.730">If I never bloomed again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.730" end="00:10.560">As my roots grow tangled</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.560" end="00:12.380">Litters rotting on read</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.380" end="00:14.250">I just close my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.250" end="00:16.890">As I get stuck within my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.890" end="00:21.810">Water the Roses</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.810" end="00:24.040">Song:Favor Foley</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.040" end="00:25.540">Art:Eddie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.430" end="00:33.430">Vocals:GUMI</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.620" end="00:37.440">Late nights alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.440" end="00:42.830">The sapling prays to grow to sow to see you through the phone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.830" end="00:44.880">Through paths unknown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.880" end="00:47.000">My heart elopes by prose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.000" end="00:48.500">Hello</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.950" end="00:49.450">Awarded best in show</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.350" end="00:52.060">My inkling shows and we’re running in circles again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.060" end="00:56.350">A worn out plea for anything to prove this poem complete</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.350" end="01:00.100">I have come to see that if it’s between you and me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.100" end="01:02.310">Words won’t get through to anyone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.310" end="01:04.200">Lost in the flower buds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.200" end="01:07.720">It’s only three words that I’m desperate to hear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.720" end="01:11.420">But I can’t be certain if you’re always no where near</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.420" end="01:15.100">If the sun grew cold proving all that I fear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.100" end="01:18.960">If I had your blessing then it all would disappear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.960" end="01:22.530">But I feel so stupid cause you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.530" end="01:26.060">And when I water the roses I can’t trust you to stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.060" end="01:28.950">So here I lay neath the shimmering moon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.950" end="01:30.740">Just a love struck fool</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.740" end="01:38.300">What do I do but wait for you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.300" end="01:42.020">Late nights inter rehearsing every word</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.020" end="01:44.780">Un heard a sonnet silent blur</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.780" end="01:47.440">&amp; sure it hurts these fighter tips covered in dirt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.440" end="01:52.150">Still digging for a love returned a single sordid verse</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.150" end="01:55.810">It’s only three words that could make me run away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.810" end="01:59.480">Moving soil like mountains for a chance at brighter days</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.480" end="02:03.210">But the eight small letters never show me their grace</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.210" end="02:06.890">Kiss a rose or push daisies under skies forever gray</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.890" end="02:10.560">And I feel so stupid cause you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.560" end="02:14.130">And when I water the roses I can’t trust you to stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.130" end="02:16.870">So here I lay neath the shimmering moon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.870" end="02:18.790">Just a love struck fool</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.790" end="02:26.790">What do I do but wait for you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.370" end="02:40.380">People come and surely they go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.380" end="02:44.200">Flowers wilt and surely they grow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.200" end="02:48.350">Oh my heart don’t spare me the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.350" end="02:52.240">When I bloom it won’t be for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.240" end="02:53.740">Oh!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.730" end="02:59.200">People come and quickly go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.200" end="03:01.320">Oh!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.320" end="03:07.820">Right through my heart will I ever grow?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.820" end="03:09.590">I guess it can’t be helped</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.590" end="03:11.440">It’s just a matter of when</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.440" end="03:13.190">If she just won’t notice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.190" end="03:15.140">Then I’ll take it on the chin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.140" end="03:16.830">If our roots separate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.830" end="03:18.840">If the roses stay dead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.840" end="03:22.570">I can plant new seeds and pen tomorrow’s flower bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.570" end="03:26.220">And I feel so stupid cause you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:26.220" end="03:29.780">And when I water the roses I can’t trust you to stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.780" end="03:32.620">So here I lay neath the shimmering moon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:32.620" end="03:34.590">Just a struck fool</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.590" end="03:42.590">What do I do but wait for you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:53.130" end="03:56.250">People come and surely they go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:56.250" end="04:00.250">Flowers wilt and surely they grow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:00.250" end="04:04.100">Oh my heart so sure of the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:04.100" end="04:08.120">When I bloom it won’t be for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:08.120" end="04:09.620">Oh!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:09.540" end="04:14.760">People come and quickly they go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:14.760" end="04:16.740">Oh!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:16.740" end="04:20.740">Soon comes the spring these roses will grow</p></div></body></tt>